From c6a2efb43b887e9592e754fcf0c30d646880bac4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bothouse-iot <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:30:56 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] bothouse-iot: animated role dial (frame packs from the web
 dial), role dial on Waveshare 1.85C

The device service sends "anim" in rh_dial: the board downloads the pack recorded from the web
dial's animated figure (tools/dial_frames.py) into PSRAM and plays the idle / thinking loops at the
pack's fps; speaking shows one still and only repaints the mouth block by playback level.
rh_dial_stats now reports anim_fps, decode_ms and psram_free. CONFIG_RH_DIAL is also offered on the
Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.85C (360 round), with CONFIG_FREERTOS_HZ=1000 like the spotpear box.
